<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 3.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 4.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   Sept 1, 2003 CCT	 pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.99 pct	 7.03</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 8.05 pct	 8.10</p>
<p>    Assigned price   101.85	  101.65</p>
<p>    Total bids	  8.966 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    3.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note-The last CCT auction was of a fifth tranche of Sept 1, 2003 certificates on October 15.</p>
</text>
